# The Dockerfile only installs packages and builds OpenSSL/sed from source; it never COPYs or ADDs
# anything from the repo. The f65 source tree reaches the container through the compose bind mount
# (./f65 -> /build), not the build context. So exclude everything from the build context to keep it
# tiny and fast (otherwise docker sends the whole multi-GB repo to the daemon on every build).
*
!Dockerfile
